{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o106a","title":"许允徙镇北未行因散官物收廷尉徙乐浪道死","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o106a-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"许允徙镇北未行因散官物收廷尉徙乐浪道死","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o106a-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-a-p066-alternative-death","label":"《魏氏春秋》","text":"《魏氏春秋》称许允为景王所诛，其妻闻讯；与《魏略》记减死徙边、道中死亡的叙述不同，分别保留。","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p066-alternative-death"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p065d-account","label":"《魏略》","text":"许允因散钱谷收狱减死徙边嘉平六年冬道死","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p065d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0069","role":"迁官获罪道死","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o106a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"李丰事觉后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o106a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o106a-q","source_order":[9,626,"O106a"],"order":2365}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0069","name":"许允","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o106a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-0769a884f01b70a317cc","layer":"original","quote":"后丰等事觉，徙允为镇北将军，假节，督河北诸军事。未发〖4〗，以放散官物〖5〗，收付廷尉；徙乐浪，道死。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":625,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p065d-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-f1ab0fb4442e4014299b","layer":"pei","quote":"会有司奏允，前擅以厨钱谷乞诸俳及其官属，故遂收送廷尉；考问竟，（故）减死，徙边。允以嘉平六年秋徙，妻子不得自随；行道未到，以其年冬死。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":636,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0f3b23485549690803dc","start":440,"end":507},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p066-alternative-death","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-b3fb00b23d11cf366efe","layer":"pei","quote":"允后为景王所诛，门生走入告其妇。妇正在机，神色不变，曰：‘早知尔耳。","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":637,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0f3b23485549690803dc","start":542,"end":576}],"profiles":{}